<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32641" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπῐ-έζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>squeeze out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπόγγος ἐξ ὕδατος ἐκπεπιεσμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.50
			</span></i> ; <i>thrust</i> or <i>force out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς προσβάλλοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.32.3
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be squeezed out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				397a23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.52
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκος ἐκπεπιεσμένον</span> a
			sore <i>that protrudes out of the skin,</i> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				25
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπλίσσομαι</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>oppress,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				12.3
			</span></i> : a form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπιεζέω</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ez.</u>
				22.29
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.74.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
